                 Note:  You cannot declare a variable based on an pointer which is a member of
                 a structure.  For example, given the structure declaration

                      declare 1 my_structure,
                                2 some_data fixed binary(7),
                                2 p pointer;

                 the following declaration is invalid:

                      declare x float binary based(p);


