                              Programmer's Utilities Guide
                      for the CP/M-86 Family of Operating Systems


          RASM-86 V1.0

             o Version 1.0 does not implement the Stack, Local,  and  Absolute
               combine types (Section 3.2.3).**

             o Version  1.0  does  not  implement  user-defined  class   names
               (Section 3.2.4).**


          LINK-86 V1.0

             o Version 1.0 does not implement the Class,  Group,  Origin,  and
               Segment command-line options (Sections 7.7.1 and 7.7.3).**

             o The general-purpose overlay manager OVLMGR.OBJ is not  included
               in  V1.0.  The  PL/I-86 Run-time Subroutine Library includes an
               overlay manager.


          ** The features that are not included in V1.0 have no impact on  the
          PL/I-86 programmer.  They will be implemented in future versions.

































